// Bogsilk web: a Bogspinner's web, greyer and wetter than a cobweb, with dew beads.
size 16 16
gradramp silk 8 #6a7a64 #9aaa90 #c8d4bc #eef4e4
gradramp dew 6 #4a8a7a #8ad0c0 #e0fff8
layer silk
key s silk.5
key t silk.3
key u silk.1
grid 0 0
